@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title MLMS - Submission and Mark Life Cycle (as implemented)
state "No submission" as None
state "SUBMITTED" as Sub
state "LATE" as Late
state "AWAITING_MODERATION" as Await
state "RETURNED" as Ret
state "APPROVED" as App
state "RELEASED" as Rel
[*] --> None
None --> Sub : submit [now <= effective deadline]
None --> Late : submit [now > effective deadline]\n/ record late days
Sub --> Sub : resubmit [before deadline, unmarked]\n/ new version, keep old
Sub --> Await : lecturer marks [deadline passed]\n/ audit MARK_ENTERED
Late --> Await : lecturer marks\n/ apply 10% per day, 0 after 3 days
Await --> Await : lecturer corrects [reason]\n/ audit MARK_CORRECTED
Await --> App : HoD approves\n/ decision + audit
Await --> App : HoD amends [reason]\n/ recalc penalty + audit
Await --> Ret : HoD returns [reason]
Ret --> Await : lecturer corrects [reason]
App --> Rel : HoD releases assignment\n[all submissions approved]
Rel --> [*]
note right of Rel : Only now can the student\nsee the mark and feedback.\nAssignment is closed.
@enduml
